0,Bukawa language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bukawa_language,"This ethnonym, which now designates Bukawa-speakers in general, derives from the name of a prominent village Bugawac (literally 'River Gawac', though no such river seems to exist) at Cape Arkona in the center of the north coast.",Bugawac,Austronesian
